// dev flavor 공통 변수 (placeholder — 본인 키로 채우기. dev.xcconfig 는 .gitignored)
PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = com.slimpumpkin.flutterStarterKit.dev
DISPLAY_NAME = FSK Dev
FLAVOR = dev
REVERSED_CLIENT_ID = com.googleusercontent.apps.YOUR_REVERSED_CLIENT_ID_HERE
FACEBOOK_APP_ID = YOUR_FACEBOOK_APP_ID_HERE
FACEBOOK_CLIENT_TOKEN = YOUR_FACEBOOK_CLIENT_TOKEN_HERE
// Kakao SDK 네이티브 앱 키 (Phase 12 D-20 — see ROADMAP.md). manual.md "## 0. Initial Setup" 절차 참조.
KAKAO_NATIVE_APP_KEY = REPLACE_WITH_DEV_NATIVE_APP_KEY
// Naver Login URL scheme (Phase 13 — see ROADMAP.md). Naver Developers Console > API 설정 > iOS > URL Scheme.
NAVER_URL_SCHEME = your-naver-url-scheme-here
// Naver Login Client ID · Secret (Phase 16.2 D-02 — see ROADMAP.md).
// naver_login_flutter 는 runtime initialize 가 없고 Info.plist 의 Nid* 키를
// plugin registration 시점에 읽는다. config/dev.json 의 naver 키와 같은 값을
// 넣는다(값 중복은 의도된 것). manual.md "## Naver Login (Phase 13)" 7단계 참조.
NAVER_CLIENT_ID = your-naver-client-id-here
NAVER_CLIENT_SECRET = your-naver-client-secret-here
// LINE Channel ID (Phase 14 — see ROADMAP.md, D-LINE-16). manual.md "## LINE Login (Phase 14)" 절차 참조.
// dev flavor 만 실 키 주입 (D-LINE-19 / memory `project_firebase_dev_only`).
LINE_CHANNEL_ID = REPLACE_WITH_DEV_LINE_CHANNEL_ID
// Yahoo!JP Login (Phase 15 — see ROADMAP.md, D-YJP-03). manual.md "## Yahoo! JAPAN Login (Phase 15)" 절차 참조.
// dev flavor 만 실 키 주입 (memory `project_firebase_dev_only`). Yahoo Developers
// Console "クライアントサイド・アプリケーション" 등록 + client_secret 0 + Redirect URI
// custom scheme = YAHOOJP_REDIRECT_SCHEME (Info.plist CFBundleURLSchemes 와 동일값).
YAHOOJP_CLIENT_ID = REPLACE_WITH_DEV_YAHOOJP_CLIENT_ID
YAHOOJP_REDIRECT_SCHEME = com.slimpumpkin.flutterStarterKit.dev.yahoojp
